  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PublicPrivate Infrastructure Advisory Facility Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPIAF is a multi-donor technical assistance facility aimed at helping developing country governments to improve the quality if their infrastructure through private sector involvement. PPIAF&apos;s mission is to help eliminate poverty and achieve sustainable development in developing countries by facilitating private sector involvement in infrastructure. PPIAF pursues its objectives through two main mechanisms (a) channeling technical assistance to governments in developing countries on strategies and measures to tap the full potential of private sector involvement; and (b) Identifying, disseminating and promoting best practices on matters related to private sector development in infrastructure in developing countries. This trust fund will receive contribution from the Asian Development Bank as part of its core contributions to PPIAF [TF055262].</narrative>
  </description>
